# Academic write-ups: a narrative overview and the PO/CO/SDG mapping. Same
# reasoning as the block above — they describe the project for a submission
# rather than documenting it for someone working on it, and they go stale
# against the code with no test to catch it.
PROJECT_OVERVIEW.md
Sentinel_PO_CO_SDG_Mapping.docx

# Agent/editor local state. settings.local.json is per-machine by definition;
# it was only being ignored by a GLOBAL ignore file on this machine, so a
# clone elsewhere would have offered to commit it.
.claude/settings.local.json

# Patch, merge and backup leftovers
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej

